    <h2>PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY</h2>
    <div class="summary">
        Results-driven Senior QA Engineer with 6+ years of progressive experience in enterprise software quality assurance, technical validation, and release governance across government, banking, and enterprise service platforms. Proven technical QA lead with deep expertise in CI/CD pipeline validation, automation framework development, security testing, performance engineering, and infrastructure verification. The sole technical QA resource in a 10-person team, mentoring junior engineers while driving cross-functional collaboration with Development, Infrastructure, PMO, BA, and client stakeholders. Demonstrated track record of delivering 7 mission-critical enterprise systems to production with zero critical defects. Seeking to leverage comprehensive technical QA leadership in a QA Team, Senior or Assistant Manager capacity.
    </div>

